    {"id":"internet-joins","art":"art/internet-joins.webp","text":"The internet joins computers together. Pages can travel from far away to your screen.","quickWords":[{"en":"internet","th":"อินเทอร์เน็ต"},{"en":"far away","th":"ไกล"},{"en":"screen","th":"หน้าจอ"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/find-things-online/internet-joins.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/find-things-online/internet-joins.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"what-is-searching","art":"art/what-is-searching.webp","text":"You type what you want to know. That is called a search.","quickWords":[{"en":"search","th":"ค้นหา"},{"en":"type","th":"พิมพ์"},{"en":"want to know","th":"อยากรู้"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/find-things-online/what-is-searching.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/find-things-online/what-is-searching.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"search-engine","art":"art/search-engine.webp","text":"A search engine keeps a giant list of pages. It shows you pages that match your words.","quickWords":[{"en":"search engine","th":"เครื่องมือค้นหา"},{"en":"list","th":"รายการ"},{"en":"match","th":"ตรงกัน"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/find-things-online/search-engine.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/find-things-online/search-engine.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"words-matter","art":"art/words-matter.webp","text":"If you want to learn about red beetles, try searching for 'red beetle' instead of just 'bug.'","quickWords":[{"en":"red beetle","th":"ด้วงสีแดง"},{"en":"searching","th":"กำลังค้นหา"},{"en":"bug","th":"แมลง"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/find-things-online/words-matter.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/find-things-online/words-matter.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"many-pages","art":"art/many-pages.webp","text":"Search for 'bug.' Then search for 'red beetle.' Which search found what you wanted? Why?","quickWords":[{"en":"search","th":"ค้นหา"},{"en":"found","th":"ค้นพบ"},{"en":"why","th":"ทำไม"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/find-things-online/many-pages.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/find-things-online/many-pages.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"ask-grown-up","art":"art/ask-grown-up.webp","text":"Search with a trusted grown-up. A result near the top is not always true or right for you.","quickWords":[{"en":"trusted grown-up","th":"ผู้ใหญ่ที่ไว้ใจ"},{"en":"result","th":"ผลการค้นหา"},{"en":"top","th":"ด้านบน"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/find-things-online/ask-grown-up.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/find-things-online/ask-grown-up.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"results-can-be-wrong","art":"art/results-can-be-wrong.webp","text":"A search result is not always true. Check who made the page, compare another page, and ask a trusted adult.","quickWords":[{"en":"search result","th":"ผลการค้นหา"},{"en":"true","th":"จริง"},{"en":"compare","th":"เปรียบเทียบ"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/find-things-online/results-can-be-wrong.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/find-things-online/results-can-be-wrong.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"anything-you-wonder","art":"art/anything-you-wonder.webp","text":"You can search for anything you want to know. Try your favorite animal today.","quickWords":[{"en":"favorite","th":"ที่ชอบที่สุด"},{"en":"animal","th":"สัตว์"},{"en":"today","th":"วันนี้"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/find-things-online/anything-you-wonder.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/find-things-online/anything-you-wonder.timing.json"}},
